iadb`\r\n[ ] `oracle`\r\n[ ] `postgres`\r\n[ ] `sqlite`\r\n[ ] `sqljs`\r\n[ ] `react-native`\r\n[ ] `expo`\r\n\r\n**TypeORM version:**\r\n\r\n[ ] `latest`\r\n[ ] `@next`\r\n[x] `0.2.11` (or put your version here)\r\n\r\n**Steps to reproduce or a small repository showing the problem:**\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nuser.ts\r\n@Index('phoneNumberIndex', ['phone.number'], { unique: true })\r\n@Entity()\r\nexport class User {\r\n    ....\r\n    @Column(type => Phone)\r\n   phone: Phone;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n```ts\r\nphone.ts\r\nexport class Phone {\r\n  ...\r\n  @Column()\r\n  number: string;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nTrying to use index on embedded documents (https://docs.mongodb.com/manual/core/index-single/#create-an-index-on-an-embedded-field)\r\n\r\nThe index created on the collection should be **phone.number**, instead **phone** index was created. \r\n\r\nMight be related to https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/issues/3142\r\n\r\n![screen shot 2019-01-16 at 20 01 06](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/453574/51281417-7b580e00-19c9-11e9-96f1-4fa044c14f48.png)\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/3437/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/3437/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2201119125,"node_id":"MDEzOkFzc2lnbmVkRXZlbnQyMjAxMTE5MTI1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typeorm/typeorm/issues/events/2201119125","actor":{"login":"AlexMesser","id":17142628,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTQyNjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17142628?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMesser","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexMesser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMesser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexMesser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com